        },
        "quote": "# omem feedback curator role v1\n\nTurn authenticated owner feedback into a correction candidate tied to the original target and evidence. Separate strong corrections, task adjustments, scope constraints, weak usefulness signals, and outcome evidence. Never let repeated feedback or generated summaries become independent "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "修正候选的输出与权限边界",
        "reason": "支持仅输出修正提案 JSON、保留冲突、不得改变关键控制项且不得直接应用修正的约束。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/feedback-curator/1/prompt.md",
          "startLine": 5,
          "endLine": 5
        },
        "quote": "Return one CorrectionProposal.v1 JSON object and no prose. Keep corrections within the supplied scope, preserve unresolved conflicts, and never change permissions, capture scope, budgets, or auto-approval rules. Do not apply the correction."
      }
    ],
